Subject: [PATCH] 3106: the weather answer's writer starts beside Claude, as
 small talk's does

The tester's 62615 on 0385: FAIL 1 of 3 (14.0 / 11.1 / 19.8 s against 12).
The server lines show the small model's turn at 4-9 s, and only after it the
Georgian writer at 4-5 s more. The weather the server found is already in
the writer's prompt (0283), so the writer now starts at once, beside Claude,
the same early path small talk uses. Claude's answer stays the fallback.

